<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Madge cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Madge cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Tim Luke said he cut his rating on Madge Networks Inc after the company reported disappointing earnings after the close on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The company reported a third quarter loss of $0.15 earnings per share below the year-ago gain of $0.27. Lehman's estimate was for a loss of $0.02, he said.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We now believe it may take several quarters for Madge to regain sales and earnings momentum,&quot; Luke said.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-3/8 to 9-1/2 in midmorning exchange trade.</p>
</text>
